      "eli5": {
        "text": "When you open the assistant today, it starts its background helper tools automatically and shows you configuration tips right after you set up your config file, so you no longer have to manually kick off those processes yourself. Behind the scenes, the team switched the build system to a newer version of Bun and reorganized how tests run, plus tightened up a few stability fixes so things like the loading spinner, websocket hang detection, and analytics events work more reliably.",
