      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "The version of the CodeBuff assistant you install just ticked up to a new release number, and that release now ships with a couple of small additions: two agents that weren't being used, called The Planner and Sketch, no longer show up in the @ mention menu, and a newer reasoning model from Google (gemini25prothinker) is now included in the default agent templates. If you update to this release you'll see a cleaner @ menu and the option to lean on that newer model out of the box. This is the standard twice-daily internal release that keeps installs current; nothing dramatic, just those two tweaks plus some behind-the-scenes build and tooling work.",
