        "v": 5,
        "title": "Enable gemini25prothinker in base agent templates",
        "summary": "Adds AgentTemplateTypes.gemini25pro_thinker to the spawnableAgents array in backend/src/templates/agents/base.ts. Updates the base prompt in backend/src/templates/base-prompts.ts to instruct agents to spawn the thinker for complex requests, specifically after file picker agents. This change affects the default agent behavior across surfaces using these backend templates.",
        "significance": "minor",
        "at": "2026-09-15T12:56:24.187Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "When you ask the assistant to handle a really tricky problem, it can now bring in a deeper-thinking helper that takes extra time to work through complex steps. The assistant was already able to call in a few different helpers, but now this new thinker is one of the options it can choose from, and the instructions tell it to summon this helper specifically for hard requests and only after it's already sent out the file-finding helpers. You probably won't notice anything unless you give it something genuinely complicated, but the system running quietly in the background is now a bit better equipped to handle it.",
        "model": "vyce/deepseek-v4.1",
